# R2 Reduction Test: Output passthrough and always-some leaf functions

Tests that leaf functions with a single unconditional rule return T directly
instead of Option T, eliminating pattern-match unwrapping at call sites.

Before R2 reduction, each leaf wraps result in Option and call sites use match-unwrap:
```
def SimpleTax_tax_amount_leaf_0 (input : SimpleTax_Input) : Option CatalaRuntime.Money :=
  some ((CatalaRuntime.multiply input.income input.rate))

def SimpleTax_effective_rate_leaf_0 (input : SimpleTax_Input) (tax_amount : CatalaRuntime.Money) : Option Rat :=
  some ((tax_amount / input.income))

def SimpleTax_effective_rate_output_leaf_0 (input : SimpleTax_Input) (effective_rate : Rat) : Option Rat :=
  some (effective_rate)

def simpleTax (input : SimpleTax_Input) : SimpleTax :=
  let _tax_amount := match SimpleTax_tax_amount_leaf_0 input with | some val => val | _ => default
  let _effective_rate := match SimpleTax_effective_rate_leaf_0 input _tax_amount with | some val => val | _ => default
  let _effective_rate_output := match SimpleTax_effective_rate_output_leaf_0 input _effective_rate with | some val => val | _ => default
  { tax_amount := _tax_amount, effective_rate_output := _effective_rate_output }
```

After R2 reduction, leaf functions return T directly and call sites are direct assignments:
```
def SimpleTax_tax_amount_leaf_0 (input : SimpleTax_Input) : CatalaRuntime.Money :=
  (CatalaRuntime.multiply input.income input.rate)

def SimpleTax_effective_rate_leaf_0 (input : SimpleTax_Input) (tax_amount : CatalaRuntime.Money) : Rat :=
  (tax_amount / input.income)

def SimpleTax_effective_rate_output_leaf_0 (input : SimpleTax_Input) (effective_rate : Rat) : Rat :=
  effective_rate

def simpleTax (input : SimpleTax_Input) : SimpleTax :=
  let _tax_amount := SimpleTax_tax_amount_leaf_0 input
  let _effective_rate := SimpleTax_effective_rate_leaf_0 input _tax_amount
  let _effective_rate_output := SimpleTax_effective_rate_output_leaf_0 input _effective_rate
  { tax_amount := _tax_amount, effective_rate_output := _effective_rate_output }
```

```catala
declaration scope SimpleTax:
  input income content money
  input rate content decimal
  output tax_amount content money
  internal effective_rate content decimal
  output effective_rate_output content decimal

scope SimpleTax:
  definition tax_amount equals income * rate
  definition effective_rate equals tax_amount / income
  definition effective_rate_output equals effective_rate
```
